-- An `initially` reading a field of the same record whose own `initially` is declared after
-- it: passes. The starting values are computed in the order they read one another, so
-- `doubled` starts at 10 (Reference §5; `InitiallyOrderTest`).
act Patient { name: text, nickname: text?
  visits: many Visit = (Visit where patient == this) }
act Visit { patient: one Patient, seenOn: Date }
act OpenChart { patient: one Patient }
shape Chart { patient: one Patient
  doubled: integer initially base * 2
  base: integer initially 5 }
rule Open when OpenChart { Chart from { patient: patient } }
